text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "All lands become 2/2 creatures until end of turn. They're still lands.", 'As Brass Herald enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\nWhen Brass Herald enters the battlefield, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all creature cards of the chosen type revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\nCreatures of the chosen type get +1/+1.', 'As Shifting Sky enters the battlefield, choose a color.\nAll nonland permanents are the chosen color.', 'As Story Circle enters the battlefield, choose a color.\n{W}: The next time a source of your choice of the chosen color would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws an additional card.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player puts the cards in their hand on the bottom of their library in any order, then draws that many cards.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, Karma deals damage to that player equal to the number of Swamps they control.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', "Beast of Burden's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures on the battlefield.", 'Blaze deals X damage to any target.', 'Change the target of target spell with a single target.', 'Change the text of target permanent by replacing all instances of one color word with another or one basic land type with another. (For example, you may change "nonblack creature" to "nongreen creature" or "forestwalk" to "islandwalk." This effect lasts indefinitely.)', 'Choose a color. Target player reveals their hand and discards all cards of that color.', 'Choose one —\n• Target player gains 3 life.\n• Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', 'Coastal Tower enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target instant spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Counter target spell. Untap up to four lands.', "Creature spells can't be countered.", "Creatures don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield, untap all creatures.", "Creatures with power greater than the number of cards in your hand can't attack.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+5 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Defender\nWhen Cinder Wall blocks, destroy it at end of combat.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFirst strike", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFlying", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFlying\nSunweb can't block creatures with power 2 or less.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Carrion Wall.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{T}: Add {G}.", "Defender, flying (This creature can't attack, and it can block creatures with flying.)", 'Destroy all Islands.', 'Destroy all Plains.', "Destroy all creatures you don't control. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact or land.', 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target attacking creature. You gain life equal to its power.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target enchantment.', "Destroy target green creature. It can't be regenerated.\nDraw a card.", 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated. You gain life equal to its toughness.", 'Destroy target tapped creature.', "Destroy target white creature. It can't be regenerated.\nDraw a card.", 'Discard a land card: Seismic Assault deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Draw a card for each creature you control.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Draw two cards, then discard a card.', 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares at least one creature type with it. (For example, if two Goblin Warriors and a Goblin Shaman are on the battlefield, each gets +2/+2.)', "Each spell costs {3} more to cast except during its controller's turn.", 'Elfhame Palace enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', "Enchant Swamp\nWhen enchanted land becomes tapped, destroy it.\nWhen Spreading Algae is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Spreading Algae to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant artifact\nYou control enchanted artifact.', 'Enchant creature\nAll creatures able to block enchanted creature do so.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't be blocked except by Walls.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Forest you control.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent, you may draw a card.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has first strike. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\n{G}: Regenerate enchanted creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Enchant land\nEnchanted land is a 5/6 green Treefolk creature that's still a land.", 'Enchant land\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of any color.', 'Enchant permanent\nYou control enchanted permanent.', 'Exile all nontoken permanents. Starting with you, each player chooses one of the exiled cards and puts it onto the battlefield tapped under their control. Repeat this process until all cards exiled this way have been chosen.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'First strike', "First strike\nWhen Nekrataal enters the battlefield, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. That creature can't be regenerated.", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Flying', "Flying\nGoblin Glider can't block.", "Flying\nMenace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\nTwo-Headed Dragon can block an additional creature each combat.\n{1}{R}: Two-Headed Dragon gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", 'Flying\nSacrifice a creature: Fallen Angel gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhen Angel of Mercy enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Sage Owl enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Flying\nWhen Vampiric Spirit enters the battlefield, you lose 4 life.', 'Flying\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.', 'Flying\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Flying\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nNightmare's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Swamps you control.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nSacrifice Spiketail Hatchling: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Aven Cloudchaser enters the battlefield, destroy target enchantment.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Aven Fisher dies, you may draw a card.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhenever Blinding Angel deals combat damage to a player, that player skips their next combat phase.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhenever Thieving Magpie deals damage to an opponent, draw a card.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{1}{U}: Return Fleeting Image to its owner's hand.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{R}: Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{W}: Aven Flock gets +0/+1 until end of turn.", 'Flying, vigilance', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", "Goblin Raider can't block.", 'Guerrilla Tactics deals 2 damage to any target.\nWhen a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Guerrilla Tactics, Guerrilla Tactics deals 4 damage to any target.', 'Hammer of Bogardan deals 3 damage to any target.\n{2}{R}{R}{R}: Return Hammer of Bogardan from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only during your upkeep.', 'Haste\nWhen Lava Hounds enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to you.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', "Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nAt the beginning of the end step, return Viashino Sandstalker to its owner's hand. (Return it only if it's on the battlefield.)", "Hulking Cyclops can't block.", 'If a source would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead.', 'If a source would deal damage to you, prevent 1 of that damage.', 'If target opponent has more cards in hand than you, draw cards equal to the difference.', 'If you control a creature, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead.', 'If you have 3 or less life, this spell costs {6} less to cast.\nFlying\nAvatar of Hope can block any number of creatures.', 'Inferno deals 6 damage to each creature and each player.', "Islands don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Lhurgoyf's power is equal to the number of creature cards in all graveyards and its toughness is equal to that number plus 1.", 'Lightning Blast deals 4 damage to any target.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', "Maro's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your hand.", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", 'Nonbasic lands are Mountains.', "Ogre Taskmaster can't block.", "Okk can't attack unless a creature with greater power also attacks.\nOkk can't block unless a creature with greater power also blocks.", "Other Elf creatures get +1/+1 and have forestwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Other Goblins get +1/+1 and have mountainwalk.', 'Other Zombie creatures get +1/+1.\n{1}{B}, {T}: Return target Zombie card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Pay 2 life: Regenerate Deepwood Ghoul.', "Phantom Warrior can't be blocked.", "Phyrexian Colossus doesn't untap during your untap step.\nPay 8 life: Untap Phyrexian Colossus.\nPhyrexian Colossus can't be blocked except by three or more creatures.", "Players play with their hands revealed.\nIf a player would draw a card, they reveal it instead. Then any other player may pay 2 life. If a player does, put that card into its owner's graveyard. Otherwise, that player draws a card.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt this turn to up to two target creatures.', "Put two target lands on top of their owners' libraries.", 'Pyroclasm deals 2 damage to each creature.', 'Pyrotechnics deals 4 damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Rain of Blades deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nSacrifice a land: Spitting Spider deals 1 damage to each creature with flying.', "Return all creatures to their owners' hands.", "Return all green permanents to their owners' hands.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Return target green card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Sacrifice Shock Troops: It deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Sacrifice a land: Coastal Hornclaw gains flying until end of turn.', 'Salt Marsh enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', "Sea Monster can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", "Search target opponent's library for a creature card and put that card onto the battlefield under your control. Then that player shuffles.", 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a blue instant card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Searing Wind deals 10 damage to any target.', 'Shivan Oasis enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Sizzle deals 3 damage to each opponent.', "Sneaky Homunculus can't block or be blocked by creatures with power 2 or greater.", "Spineless Thug can't block.", 'Star Compass enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color that a basic land you control could produce.', "Sudden Impact deals damage to target player equal to the number of cards in that player's hand.", "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Swarm of Rats's power is equal to the number of Rats you control.", 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Llanowar Behemoth gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards a card for each Swamp you control.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player draws two cards.', 'Target player gains X life.', 'Target player loses 4 life and you gain 4 life.', "This spell can't be countered.\nDestroy all artifacts, creatures, and lands. They can't be regenerated.", "Tidal Kraken can't be blocked.", 'Tremor deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase.', "Up to three target creatures can't block this turn.", 'Urborg Volcano enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Vicious Hunger deals 2 damage to target creature and you gain 2 life.', 'Vigilance', 'Volcanic Hammer deals 3 damage to any target.', "Wall creatures can attack as though they didn't have defender.", 'When Death Pit Offering enters the battlefield, sacrifice all creatures you control.\nCreatures you control get +2/+2.', 'When Elvish Pioneer enters the battlefield, you may put a basic land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped.', 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Hunted Wumpus enters the battlefield, each other player may put a creature card from their hand onto the battlefield.', 'When Maggot Carrier enters the battlefield, each player loses 1 life.', 'When Merchant of Secrets enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Primeval Force enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice three Forests.', 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Rukh Egg dies, create a 4/4 red Bird creature token with flying at the beginning of the next end step.', 'When Serpent Warrior enters the battlefield, you lose 3 life.', 'When Staunch Defenders enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', 'When Venerable Monk enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'When Wood Elves enters the battlefield, search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "When Wrath of Marit Lage enters the battlefield, tap all red creatures.\nRed creatures don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", 'When you control no other creatures, sacrifice Emperor Crocodile.', 'Whenever City of Brass becomes tapped, it deals 1 damage to you.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Whenever Deathgazer blocks or becomes blocked by a nonblack creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever Elite Javelineer blocks, it deals 1 damage to target attacking creature.', 'Whenever Fungusaur is dealt damage, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Whenever Giant Badger blocks, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Lesser Gargadon attacks or blocks, sacrifice a land.', 'Whenever Seasoned Marshal attacks, you may tap target creature.', 'Whenever a Forest is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional {G}.', "Whenever a creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, return that creature to its owner's hand. (It won't be affected by the spell or ability.)", "Whenever a creature dies, that creature's controller may draw a card.", "Whenever a creature is dealt damage, destroy it. It can't be regenerated.", 'Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card.', 'Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to an opponent, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage, you gain that much life.', 'Whenever a creature you control dies, each other player sacrifices a creature.', "Whenever a land is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, Dingus Egg deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", "Whenever a permanent is returned to a player's hand, that player discards a card.", 'Whenever a player casts a black spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a blue spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a green spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a red spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a white spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a spell or ability an opponent controls causes a land to be put into your graveyard from the battlefield, return that card to the battlefield.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell, Mogg Sentry gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever an opponent discards a card, Megrim deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, Underworld Dreams deals 1 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent taps a Mountain for mana, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, you may draw a card.', 'Yavimaya Enchantress gets +1/+1 for each enchantment on the battlefield.', "You and target opponent each flip a coin. Mana Clash deals 1 damage to each player whose coin comes up tails. Repeat this process until both players' coins come up heads on the same flip.", 'You draw three cards and you lose 3 life.', 'You gain 2 life for each creature you control.', 'You gain 3 life for each creature attacking you.', 'You gain 4 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.', "You have shroud. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", "You may have Lone Wolf assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", "You may have Rhox assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.\n{2}{G}: Regenerate Rhox. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "You may have Thorn Elemental assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", 'You may tap or untap target artifact, creature, or land.', 'Your opponents play with their hands revealed.', "{1}: Return target land you control to its owner's hand.\n{1}, Discard a land card: Draw a card.", '{1}: The next time a black source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a blue source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a green source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a red source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a white source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{2}, {T}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', '{2}, {T}: Target player mills two cards.', "{2}{G}{G}: Reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your graveyard.", '{2}{U}{U}: Draw a card.', '{3}, {T}: Rod of Ruin deals 1 damage to any target.', '{3}, {T}: Target player chooses a card name, then reveals the top card of their library. If that card has the chosen name, that player puts it into their hand. Otherwise, they put it into their graveyard and Vexing Arcanix deals 2 damage to them.', '{3}, {T}: Target player discards a card. Activate only during your turn.', '{3}: Patagia Golem gains flying until end of turn.', '{4}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Fodder Cannon deals 4 damage to target creature.', '{4}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{5}, {T}: Return target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{6}, {T}: Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', "{8}, {T}: Aladdin's Ring deals 4 damage to any target.", '{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player discards that card. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{B}: Looming Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}: Primeval Shambler gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "{B}: Regenerate Drudge Skeletons. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "{B}{B}, Pay half your life, rounded up: Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", '{B}{B}, {T}: Destroy target green creature.', '{B}{B}, {T}: Destroy target white creature.', '{G}, Sacrifice a Forest: Foratog gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Elvish Lyrist: Destroy target enchantment.', '{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Elvish Scrapper: Destroy target artifact.', '{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{G}, {T}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{G}: Regenerate Horned Troll.', '{R}, {T}: Anaba Shaman deals 1 damage to any target.', '{R}: Ridgeline Rager gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Daring Apprentice: Counter target spell.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Plaguelord: Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.\nSacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', "{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Bloodshot Cyclops deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to any target.", '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Draw a card.', "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Power-Plant, add {C}{C}{C} instead.", "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Tower, add {C}{C} instead.", "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Power-Plant and an Urza's Tower, add {C}{C} instead.", '{T}: Add {G}{G}.', "{T}: All damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn by a source of your choice is dealt to Oracle's Attendants instead.", '{T}: Crossbow Infantry deals 1 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{T}: Destroy target Wall.', '{T}: Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.', '{T}: Destroy target tapped creature.', '{T}: Draw a card.', '{T}: Elite Archers deals 3 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', "{T}: Look at the top three cards of target player's library.", '{T}: Orcish Artillery deals 2 damage to any target and 3 damage to you.', '{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', '{T}: Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', '{T}: Target permanent becomes the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{U}, {T}: You may tap or untap target creature.', "{U}{U}{U}, {T}: Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{W}: Honor Guard gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', '{W}{W}: Target attacking creature gets -1/-0 until end of turn.']
